(3004025, 3000324, NULL, 'READING', 'N4', 'MEDIUM', 'MULTIPLE_CHOICE', 'choice', '(Đọc và chọn đáp án đúng)', NULL, '時計があると、便利だから。', '時計の修理が好きだから。', '時計の音を聞きながら寝たいから。', NULL, 2, 'Ông nói 「壊れた時計を直すと、動きますね。それが楽しいんです」, nên đáp án là vì ông thích sửa đồng hồ.Xem trong bài ↑', '{"source":"VNJPCLUB","stable_code":"MINNA-SO-CAP-2-N4-L049-QUE-001","review_status":"NGUON","loai_cau":"mot_dap_an","nguon_dap_an":null,"answer_uncertain":false,"ly_do_uncertain":null,"source_url":"https://www.vnjpclub.com/minna-no-nihongo/bai-30-25-bai-doc-hieu.html","parent_code":"MINNA-SO-CAP-2-N4-L049-RDG-007","label":"choice","question_translation":null,"empty_question_text":true,"inline":true,"not_inline_reason":null,"answer":2,"options":[{"index":1,"text":"時計があると、便利だから。","translation":null,"is_correct":false,"reason":null},{"index":2,"text":"時計の修理が好きだから。","translation":null,"is_correct":true,"reason":null},{"index":3,"text":"時計の音を聞きながら寝たいから。","translation":null,"is_correct":false,"reason":null}],"audio_hint":[],"passage_code":"MINNA-SO-CAP-2-N4-L049-RDG-007"}', 1, 0, '<p>――将来、時計の博物館を作りたいと思っていますか。<br>ええ。でも、今はお金がありませんから…。<br>しばらくこのままにしておきます。</p>', 'vnjpclub/N4/minna-so-cap-2/img/bai-30_clock-collector.webp'),
(3004026, 3000324, NULL, 'READING', 'N4', 'MEDIUM', 'MULTIPLE_CHOICE', 'choice', '(Đọc và chọn đáp án đúng)', NULL, '時計を直すから。', '時計のねじを巻いているから。', '骨董屋からうちまで時計を運ぶから。', NULL, 2, 'Bài viết cho biết 「1日中時計のねじを巻いていますから、右手がいつも痛い」: ông đau tay vì lên dây cót đồng hồ suốt ngày.Xem trong bài ↑', '{"source":"VNJPCLUB","stable_code":"MINNA-SO-CAP-2-N4-L049-QUE-002","review_status":"NGUON","loai_cau":"mot_dap_an","nguon_dap_an":null,"answer_uncertain":false,"ly_do_uncertain":null,"source_url":"https://www.vnjpclub.com/minna-no-nihongo/bai-30-25-bai-doc-hieu.html","parent_code":"MINNA-SO-CAP-2-N4-L049-RDG-007","label":"choice","question_translation":null,"empty_question_text":true,"inline":true,"not_inline_reason":null,"answer":2,"options":[{"index":1,"text":"時計を直すから。","translation":null,"is_correct":false,"reason":null},{"index":2,"text":"時計のねじを巻いているから。","translation":null,"is_correct":true,"reason":null},{"index":3,"text":"骨董屋からうちまで時計を運ぶから。","translation":null,"is_correct":false,"reason":null}],"audio_hint":[],"passage_code":"MINNA-SO-CAP-2-N4-L049-RDG-007"}', 2, 0, '<p>――将来、時計の博物館を作りたいと思っていますか。<br>ええ。でも、今はお金がありませんから…。<br>しばらくこのままにしておきます。</p>', 'vnjpclub/N4/minna-so-cap-2/img/bai-30_clock-collector.webp'),
