(3004030, 3000324, NULL, 'READING', 'N4', 'MEDIUM', 'MULTIPLE_CHOICE', 'choice', '(Đọc và chọn đáp án đúng)', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Lời chào 「お帰りなさい」 cùng lời dặn 「お皿とコップは洗っておいてね」 cho thấy đây là mẹ nhắn cho con về đồ ăn đã chuẩn bị và giờ mẹ về.Xem trong bài ↑', '{"source":"VNJPCLUB","stable_code":"MINNA-SO-CAP-2-N4-L049-QUE-006","review_status":"NGUON","loai_cau":"mot_dap_an","nguon_dap_an":null,"answer_uncertain":false,"ly_do_uncertain":null,"source_url":"https://www.vnjpclub.com/minna-no-nihongo/bai-30-25-bai-doc-hieu.html","parent_code":"MINNA-SO-CAP-2-N4-L049-RDG-012","label":"choice","question_translation":null,"empty_question_text":true,"inline":false,"not_inline_reason":"5_phuong_an","answer":4,"options":[{"index":1,"text":"社員→課長","translation":null,"is_correct":false,"reason":null},{"index":2,"text":"息子→お母さん","translation":null,"is_correct":false,"reason":null},{"index":3,"text":"家政婦→家の人","translation":null,"is_correct":false,"reason":null},{"index":4,"text":"お母さん→子ども","translation":null,"is_correct":true,"reason":null},{"index":5,"text":"夫→妻","translation":null,"is_correct":false,"reason":null}],"audio_hint":[],"passage_code":"MINNA-SO-CAP-2-N4-L049-RDG-012"}', 6, 0, '<p>5)<br>絶対にビデオに触らないで。<br>今晩8時からサッカーの試合が予約してあるから。<br>それから今晩は彼女と食事するから、晩ごはんは要らないよ。</p>', NULL),
