(3004653, 3000371, NULL, 'READING', 'N4', 'MEDIUM', 'FILL_BLANK', 'Mẫu câu', '次に （＿＿＿） ください。', 'テレホンカードを 入れて', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '次に （テレホンカードを 入れて） ください。 それから （番号を 押します）。 話が 終わったら、まず （受話器を 置きます）。次に （テレホンカードを 取ります）。\nTiếp theo, hãy đưa thẻ điện thoại vào. Sau đó, bấm số điện thoại. Khi nói chuyện xong, trước tiên đặt ống nghe xuống. Tiếp theo, lấy thẻ điện thoại ra.\n① có sẵn ください nên điền thể て. Các bước sau có thể viết 〜ます hoặc 〜て ください. 受話器 là ống nghe.', '{"source":"VNJPCLUB","stable_code":"MINNA-SO-CAP-2-N4-L096-QUE-023","review_status":"NGUON","loai_cau":"dien","nguon_dap_an":null,"answer_uncertain":false,"ly_do_uncertain":null,"source_url":"https://www.vnjpclub.com/minna-no-nihongo/bai-34-luyen-tap-mau-cau.html","parent_code":"MINNA-SO-CAP-2-N4-L096-RDG-001","label":null,"question_translation":null,"empty_question_text":false,"inline":false,"not_inline_reason":null,"answer":null,"options":[],"audio_hint":[],"answer_text":"テレホンカードを 入れて","common_images":["vnjpclub/N4/minna-so-cap-2/img/bai-34_p6-phone-0.webp","vnjpclub/N4/minna-so-cap-2/img/bai-34_p6-phone-1.webp","vnjpclub/N4/minna-so-cap-2/img/bai-34_p6-phone-2.webp","vnjpclub/N4/minna-so-cap-2/img/bai-34_p6-phone-3.webp","vnjpclub/N4/minna-so-cap-2/img/bai-34_p6-phone-4.webp","vnjpclub/N4/minna-so-cap-2/img/bai-34_p6-copy-1.webp","vnjpclub/N4/minna-so-cap-2/img/bai-34_p6-copy-2.webp","vnjpclub/N4/minna-so-cap-2/img/bai-34_p6-copy-3.webp","vnjpclub/N4/minna-so-cap-2/img/bai-34_p6-copy-4.webp"]}', 23, 0, NULL, NULL),
(3004654, 3000371, NULL, 'READING', 'N4', 'MEDIUM', 'FILL_BLANK', 'Mẫu câu', 'まず お金を （＿＿＿）て、次に 紙を （＿＿＿）。', '入れ / 置きます', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'まず お金を 入れて、次に 紙を 置きます。 それから スタートボタンを 押します。 コピーが 終わったら、お釣りの ボタンを 押します。\nTrước tiên cho tiền vào, tiếp theo đặt giấy lên máy. Sau đó bấm nút bắt đầu. Khi photocopy xong, bấm nút lấy tiền thừa.\n① đã có て ở ngoài ô, chỉ điền 入れ để thành 入れて. まず → 次に → それから: trước tiên → tiếp theo → sau đó.', '{"source":"VNJPCLUB","stable_code":"MINNA-SO-CAP-2-N4-L096-QUE-024","review_status":"NGUON","loai_cau":"dien","nguon_dap_an":null,"answer_uncertain":false,"ly_do_uncertain":null,"source_url":"https://www.vnjpclub.com/minna-no-nihongo/bai-34-luyen-tap-mau-cau.html","parent_code":"MINNA-SO-CAP-2-N4-L096-RDG-001","label":null,"question_translation":null,"empty_question_text":false,"inline":false,"not_inline_reason":null,"answer":null,"options":[],"audio_hint":[],"answer_text":"入れ / 置きます","common_images":["vnjpclub/N4/minna-so-cap-2/img/bai-34_p6-phone-0.webp","vnjpclub/N4/minna-so-cap-2/img/bai-34_p6-phone-1.webp","vnjpclub/N4/minna-so-cap-2/img/bai-34_p6-phone-2.webp","vnjpclub/N4/minna-so-cap-2/img/bai-34_p6-phone-3.webp","vnjpclub/N4/minna-so-cap-2/img/bai-34_p6-phone-4.webp","vnjpclub/N4/minna-so-cap-2/img/bai-34_p6-copy-1.webp","vnjpclub/N4/minna-so-cap-2/img/bai-34_p6-copy-2.webp","vnjpclub/N4/minna-so-cap-2/img/bai-34_p6-copy-3.webp","vnjpclub/N4/minna-so-cap-2/img/bai-34_p6-copy-4.webp"]}', 24, 0, NULL, NULL),
(3004655, 3000371, NULL, 'READING', 'N4', 'MEDIUM', 'FILL_BLANK', 'Mẫu câu', 'さっき わたしが ＿＿＿（説明する／説明した） とおりに、やって ください。', '説明した', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'さっき わたしが 説明した とおりに、やって ください。\nHãy làm đúng như tôi vừa giải thích.\nさっき là vừa nãy: việc giải thích đã xảy ra, nên dùng 説明した.', '{"source":"VNJPCLUB","stable_code":"MINNA-SO-CAP-2-N4-L096-QUE-025","review_status":"NGUON","loai_cau":"dien","nguon_dap_an":null,"answer_uncertain":false,"ly_do_uncertain":null,"source_url":"https://www.vnjpclub.com/minna-no-nihongo/bai-34-luyen-tap-mau-cau.html","parent_code":"MINNA-SO-CAP-2-N4-L096-RDG-001","label":null,"question_translation":null,"empty_question_text":false,"inline":false,"not_inline_reason":null,"answer":null,"options":[],"audio_hint":[],"answer_text":"説明した","common_images":["vnjpclub/N4/minna-so-cap-2/img/bai-34_p6-phone-0.webp","vnjpclub/N4/minna-so-cap-2/img/bai-34_p6-phone-1.webp","vnjpclub/N4/minna-so-cap-2/img/bai-34_p6-phone-2.webp","vnjpclub/N4/minna-so-cap-2/img/bai-34_p6-phone-3.webp","vnjpclub/N4/minna-so-cap-2/img/bai-34_p6-phone-4.webp","vnjpclub/N4/minna-so-cap-2/img/bai-34_p6-copy-1.webp","vnjpclub/N4/minna-so-cap-2/img/bai-34_p6-copy-2.webp","vnjpclub/N4/minna-so-cap-2/img/bai-34_p6-copy-3.webp","vnjpclub/N4/minna-so-cap-2/img/bai-34_p6-copy-4.webp"]}', 25, 0, NULL, NULL),
