(3006018, 3000477, NULL, 'READING', 'N4', 'MEDIUM', 'MULTIPLE_CHOICE', 'Nghe', 'Vì sao người trả lời chảy nước mắt?', NULL, 'Vì cười quá nhiều', 'Vì buồn', 'Vì đau mắt', 'Vì trời lạnh', 1, '…いいえ、笑いすぎて、涙が 出たんです。', '{"source":"VNJPCLUB","stable_code":"MINNA-SO-CAP-2-N4-L202-QUE-002","review_status":"NGUON","loai_cau":"mot_dap_an","nguon_dap_an":null,"answer_uncertain":false,"ly_do_uncertain":null,"source_url":"https://www.vnjpclub.com/minna-no-nihongo/bai-44-luyen-doc.html","parent_code":"MINNA-SO-CAP-2-N4-L202-RDG-002","label":"Nghe","question_translation":null,"empty_question_text":false,"inline":true,"not_inline_reason":null,"answer":1,"options":[{"index":1,"text":"Vì cười quá nhiều","translation":null,"is_correct":true,"reason":null},{"index":2,"text":"Vì buồn","translation":null,"is_correct":false,"reason":null},{"index":3,"text":"Vì đau mắt","translation":null,"is_correct":false,"reason":null},{"index":4,"text":"Vì trời lạnh","translation":null,"is_correct":false,"reason":null}],"audio_hint":[{"url":"https://www.vnjpclub.com/Audio/minnamoi/bunkeireibun/100010000002.mp3","link_level":"cau_hoi_cung_bai","review_status":"NGUON"}],"passage_code":"MINNA-SO-CAP-2-N4-L202-RDG-002"}', 2, 0, '<p>泣いて いるんですか。<br>…いいえ、笑いすぎて、涙が 出たんです。<br>最近の 車は 操作が 簡単ですね。<br>…ええ。でも、簡単すぎて、運転が おもしろくないです。<br>田舎と 町と、どちらが 住みやすいですか。<br>…田舎の ほうが 住みやすいと 思います。物価も 安いし、空気も きれいですから。<br>この コップは 丈夫で 割れにくいですよ。<br>…子どもが 使うのに 安全で、いいですね。<br>もう 夜 遅いですから、静かに して いただけませんか。<br>…はい。すみません。<br>飲み物は 何に しますか。<br>…ビールに します。</p>', NULL),
