(3006021, 3000478, NULL, 'READING', 'N4', 'MEDIUM', 'MULTIPLE_CHOICE', 'tf', '(Đọc và chọn đáp án đúng)', NULL, 'Đúng', 'Sai', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Sai. Người Anh đã đổi cách làm cho hợp khẩu vị của mình, người Nhật học cách làm ấy: 「このイギリスの作り方を習いました」.Xem trong bài ↑', '{"source":"VNJPCLUB","stable_code":"MINNA-SO-CAP-2-N4-L203-QUE-001","review_status":"NGUON","loai_cau":"mot_dap_an","nguon_dap_an":null,"answer_uncertain":false,"ly_do_uncertain":null,"source_url":"https://www.vnjpclub.com/minna-no-nihongo/bai-44-25-bai-doc-hieu.html","parent_code":"MINNA-SO-CAP-2-N4-L203-RDG-012","label":"tf","question_translation":null,"empty_question_text":true,"inline":true,"not_inline_reason":null,"answer":1,"options":[{"index":1,"text":"Đúng","translation":null,"is_correct":true,"reason":null},{"index":2,"text":"Sai","translation":null,"is_correct":false,"reason":null}],"audio_hint":[],"passage_code":"MINNA-SO-CAP-2-N4-L203-RDG-012","passage_images":["vnjpclub/N4/minna-so-cap-2/img/bai-44_temperature-graph.webp","vnjpclub/N4/minna-so-cap-2/img/bai-44_curry-powder.webp","vnjpclub/N4/minna-so-cap-2/img/bai-44_curry-roux.webp","vnjpclub/N4/minna-so-cap-2/img/bai-44_retort-curry.webp","vnjpclub/N4/minna-so-cap-2/img/bai-44_cup-noodles.webp","vnjpclub/N4/minna-so-cap-2/img/bai-44_instant-curry-rice.webp","vnjpclub/N4/minna-so-cap-2/img/bai-44_canned-curry.webp"]}', 1, 0, '<p>カレーはいろいろなスパイスで作られています。<br>辛いスパイスを食べると、体温が上がりますが、その後だんだん下がります。<br>カレーは体温を下げるので、暑い夏に食べるといいと言う人もいます。</p>', 'vnjpclub/N4/minna-so-cap-2/img/bai-44_temperature-graph.webp'),
